# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are in this file. The format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## How to read this

Every entry under `## [Unreleased]` and under each later version starts with a tag, a colon and a space. The tags of this repo are: {{TAGS_COLON}}

`dev:` is the team-tooling tag: CI, docs, scripts and agent rules. `dev:` lines stay out of the public release notes (`bash scripts/release-notes.sh Unreleased`). The other tags name a part of the product.

Example entry: `- dev: Add the owners check to CI.`

